{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14249","headline":"求自试 · 窦常","name":"求自试","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙禁祥云合，高梧彩凤游。\n沈冥求自试，通鉴果蒙收。\n文墨悲无位，诗书误白头。\n陈王抗表日，毛遂请行秋。\n双剑曾埋狱，司空问斗牛。\n希垂拂拭惠，感激愿相投。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}